        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Canaropa EP316-30-630, Stainless Steel Fingertip Flush Pull for Sliding Pocket Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFingertip pulls such as this one are a simple solution to the problem of getting pocket doors out of their pocket. The Modern Fingertip Edge Pull is pressured mounted into the door, for an easy, screw-less installation. It has a satin stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-EP316-30-dimentions.gif?v=1704354516\" width=\"408\" height=\"156\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Canaropa EP316-30 Stainless Steel Flush Pull Dimensions\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 1-1/8\" Diameter Small Edge Door Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Length: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Dimeter: 31/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
